@* NeuroBlueMinds.Client/Components/PageLoading.razor
   Spinner mostrado mientras:
   - Blazor WASM carga por primera vez (evita el flash de 404)
   - AuthorizeRouteView está verificando el estado de auth
   Este componente se registra globalmente en _Imports.razor *@
@namespace NeuroBlueMinds.Client.Components

<div class="min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center"
     style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e3a8a 60%, #0369a1 100%);">
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-4">
        <img src="android-chrome-512x512.png"
             class="w-16 h-16 rounded-2xl opacity-80 animate-pulse"
             alt="BlueMinds" />
        <div class="w-10 h-10 border-4 border-white/20 border-t-white rounded-full animate-spin"></div>
    </div>
</div>
